<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Branch Login Credentials</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;
      max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; } .header {
      background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align:
      center; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; } .content { background-color:
      #f9f9f9; padding: 20px; border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px; } .credentials {
      background-color: #e8f5e8; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px
      0; } .label { font-weight: bold; color: #2e7d32; } .footer { text-align:
      center; margin-top: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome to Wealth Train</h1>
      <p>Your Branch Account Has Been Created</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello,</p>

      <p>Your branch account has been successfully created. Here are your login
        credentials:</p>

      <div class="credentials">
        <p><span class="label">Email:</span> {{email}}</p>
        <p><span class="label">Password:</span> {{password}}</p>
      </div>

      <p><strong>Important:</strong>
        Please change your password after your first login for security
        purposes.</p>

      <p>You can now access your branch dashboard and start managing your
        operations.</p>

      <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact our
        support team.</p>

      <p>Best regards,<br />
        The Wealth Train Team</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
      <p>&copy; 2024 Wealth Train. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>